# Slice 309, the vertical slice (a) of the kernel implementation specification: an initialized int, arithmetic and a
# repeated write on the clean graph. The check compares the graph after execution with init_arith.expected.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: x 0
)
int: x 5
x := x + 1
x := 7

sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\x := x
main()
